  "_idComment": "playhqProfileId is the play.cricket.com.au PROFILE id from the club's own sheet. It is NOT the appearance id the public API returns, which changes every game — matching in scripts/playhq/ stays by name via aliases. Treat these as reference only.",
  "_privacyComment": "Names and public profile URLs only. Never add emails, phone numbers, addresses or dates of birth to this file — see CLAUDE.md.",
  "_teamsComment": "teams[] lists every side a player turns out for. A player who plays Saturday and Sunday carries both slugs and is one entry, not two — the stats aggregate adds their figures together. A side with no players here shows an empty squad section rather than a guess.",
  "_captaincyComment": "captaincy is either a string, which applies to every side the player turns out for, or an object keyed by team slug when it differs between them — a LOC 2 vice-captain who also plays Grade 4 is not Grade 4's vice-captain."
}
